      "message": "Tried these before, as mentioned in the commit message, the parameter needs to be passed as soon as possible. CALL_STATE_OFFHOOK is useless since thats only triggered once the call is already dialing/established (which would be too late -\u003e no audio). Besides that, CALL_STATE_RINGING is only triggered for incoming calls, not for outgoing ones. I tried all possible combinations with CALL_STATE_*, none of those worked out for outgoing calls.",
